# ── Frontend environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
# In local dev, leave VITE_API_URL empty — the Vite dev-server proxy
# (configured in vite.config.ts) will forward /api requests to the
# backend running on localhost:5001.
#
# In production, set VITE_API_URL to the full backend URL including
# the /api prefix, e.g. https://your-space-name.hf.space/api
VITE_API_URL=
